# .cotal/ holds live mesh state: NATS operator/account seeds (auth/broker.json),
# minted creds (*.creds, auth/creds/), the web console bearer token (manager.log),
# JWTs embedded in server.conf, JetStream store data (nats/), and pid/log files.
# None of that may ever reach the public repo. Deny-all, then allow-list only the
# persona files, which are plain markdown with no secrets in them.
*
!.gitignore
!agents/
!agents/*.md
